1
00:00:00,768 --> 00:00:03,928
(Sheldon:)My tongue won't go as far forward
as it used to.

2
00:00:04,939 --> 00:00:07,639
(Leonard:)Maybe your tongue is shrinking.

3
00:00:14,883 --> 00:00:16,643
(Sheldon(measures):)Nope.

4
00:00:20,922 --> 00:00:23,412
(Sheldon(measures):)Oh, you have no idea
how annoying this is.

5
00:00:24,559 --> 00:00:27,429
(Leonard:)I'm starting to get a sense of it.

6
00:00:28,963 --> 00:00:31,433
(Leonard:)Don't worry, I'll take you
to the dentist tomorrow.

7
00:00:31,599 --> 00:00:33,089
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

8
00:00:33,268 --> 00:00:36,928
(Sheldon:)I appreciate that.
You're good people, Leonard.

9
00:00:45,747 --> 00:00:48,477
(Sheldon:)- There's something I need to tell you.
- Okay.

10
00:00:50,518 --> 00:00:52,508
(Sheldon:)I can't tell you.

11
00:00:54,022 --> 00:00:55,512
(Penny:)Why?

12
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:59,020
(Sheldon:)I can't tell you why I can't tell you.

